      "created_at": "2025-08-18T04:24:40.641Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/ali-88\">@Ali-88</a></p>\n<p>Please check highlighted fields precision if those are set on 3 level of fraction or not.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/0/50451dc6b4d8355aefe0cb74bda4aba651af5930.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/50451dc6b4d8355aefe0cb74bda4aba651af5930\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/0/50451dc6b4d8355aefe0cb74bda4aba651af5930_2_690x320.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"bs6hh95we79OLCCpvL74JtnRtyo\" width=\"690\" height=\"320\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/0/50451dc6b4d8355aefe0cb74bda4aba651af5930_2_690x320.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/0/50451dc6b4d8355aefe0cb74bda4aba651af5930_2_1035x480.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/0/50451dc6b4d8355aefe0cb74bda4aba651af5930_2_1380x640.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAF9F5\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1873×871 66.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>You can do it by <strong>Customizing Journal Entry</strong> doctype otherwise set precision/fraction by visiting System Setting <strong>Globally</strong>.</p>",
